Prefix-sum + hashmap: at each index, look up prefix_sum - k. O(n).

```python
def longest_subarray_sum_k(nums, k):
    best = 0
    cur = 0
    seen = {0: -1}
    for i, n in enumerate(nums):
        cur += n
        if cur - k in seen:
            best = max(best, i - seen[cur - k])
        seen.setdefault(cur, i)
    return best
```

